			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				155,
				2
			],
			"Message": "feat(Maintain): Enhance exclusion patterns for generated files in Rust and TypeScript formats\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "ada8a60cbba418af7af01adbdf95e9accc98ccd7"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-12T02:11:30Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				155,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Maintain): Resolve ProductFlavor into product.json identifiers\n\nThe previous overlay-merge pattern treated all product identity fields uniformly, but the new ProductFlavor build code must drive per-field identifier generation (applicationName, dataFolderName, urlProtocol, serverApplicationName, embedderIdentifier) with both a compact 10-char encoding and a human-readable long form. Replace the generic merge with direct property assignment so each identity field is computed from the flavor env vars.\n\nAdd ProductFlavor and ProductFlavorLong shell defaults and exports so the script remains self-contained when invoked standalone. Update the defaults source comment from .env.Land.Sample to .env.Land.\n\nproduct.json now carries flavor-scoped identifiers (e.g. fiddee-IWTNMMMMMM), enabling parallel installs of different build flavors without data-folder or URL-protocol collisions.",
			"SHA": "1f1e719b2005a8e65aa7c06e5064291f8b5cb55d"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-12T02:11:02Z",
			"File": [
				"⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				155,
				7
			],
			"Message": "docs(Land): Document ProductFlavor encoding and normalize doc formatting\n\nAdd the ProductFlavor 10-char encoding scheme to EnvironmentVariables.md and the TierGatedImplementationSelection workflow doc, covering the 5x2-char routing code groups (IPC+WS, Tasks+Auth, Terminal+SCM+Debug, Search+Language+Output, Storage+Model+FileSystem) and all four flavor variants (Default/RustOnly/Node/Full+MistWS). Also update the ProductEmbedderIdentifier default from land-desktop to fiddee-desktop.\n\nNormalize list separator punctuation across BuildPipeline.md, Building.md, EditorCore.md, and InterComponentProtocol.md, replacing em dashes with spaced hyphens for consistent rendering. Reflow overlong paragraph lines at the established 100-char width in EditorCore.md, InterComponentProtocol.md, and VSCode-API-Coverage-Matrix.md. Adjust table column widths in InterComponentProtocol.md for uniform Markdown rendering.",
			"SHA": "ea90e33dea6729a69dd069711b8141f7aca31a81"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-12T02:10:37Z",
			"File": [
				"⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				155,
				6
			],
			"Message": "build(Land): Add ProductFlavor codes to build flavours and bump Tauri deps\n\nAnnotate each build flavour overlay with its ProductFlavor 10-char routing code:\n- Full (IFTNMMMMMM): IPC NodeDeferred, Mist WS, Mountain tasks/auth, rest Mountain\n- NodeFirst (INTNNNNNNN): all tiers routed through Cocoon Node.js\n- RustOnly (IWTAMMMMMM): all tiers Mountain-native, no Node fallback\n\nDocument the ProductFlavor 5×2-char encoding scheme in .env.Land.Sample:\n  IPC+WS, Tasks+Auth, Terminal+SCM+Debug, Search+Language+Output, Storage..Encryption\n\nAdd .lycheeignore to suppress known-false-positive link checker failures for shields.io badges, grace-hold domains (editor.land), NLnet URLs, and npmjs.com rate limits.\n\nBump three Tauri plugin crate versions to match their published releases:\n- tauri-plugin-barcode-scanner 2.4.4 → 2.4.5\n- tauri-plugin-global-shortcut 2.3.1 → 2.3.2\n- tauri-plugin-positioner 2.3.1 → 2.3.2",
			"SHA": "07fb476818e0173efdd6d9c0adb52da3a43374de"
		}
	],
